{"metadata":{"description":"DSH Ox-Horse Office - a DeepSeek Harness web plugin rendering multi-agent sessions as a live pixi.js office","id":"gh:1338386012","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-office-plugin","slug":"geguanming/dsh-office-plugin","topics":["agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-web","dsh-web-ui","multi-agent","pixel-art","pixi-js","visualization","webgl"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH Ox-Horse Office - a DeepSeek Harness web plugin rendering multi-agent sessions as a live pixi.js"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"Horse Office - a DeepSeek Harness web plugin rendering multi-agent sessions as a live pixi.js office"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Ox-Horse Office"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DSH Ox-Horse Office is a Web UI plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) that renders the live activity of "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"your multi-agent sessions as a pixel-art office. Every agent session becomes an ox/horse worker with"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" its own badge -- running agents type at their desks, idle ones wander and nap, and you are the boss"},{"id":"p4s4","text":", sitting in the corner office wearing a crown."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> 🌟 **If this project made you smile or helped you out, please give it a Star -- it really helps, th"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"his project made you smile or helped you out, please give it a Star -- it really helps, thank you!**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Cast"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Role | Who | Where | Looks |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| **The Boss** | You, the user | Private corner office (bottom-right) | Dark-brown suit coat, gold t"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"rim, glasses, golden crown |
| **The Supervisor** | The current session (the agent you are talking t"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"o) | Supervisor desk above the open office floor | Golden coat + orange foreman helmet |
| **Workers"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"** | All other sessions (subagents included) | 4×4 desk grid | Randomly ox or horse; coat and access"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"ories are stable per session id |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The office holds up to 16 workers (supervisor included); overflowing running sessions show up as "qu"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"eued" and take a seat as earlier ones finish."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Live office activity"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **Working / slacking**: a running session types at its desk with a scrolling-code screen and a blu"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"e glow; an idle one just sits, and after a while falls asleep at the desk (Zzz bubbles).
- **Speech "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"bubbles**: streaming output, tools in flight, and latest reports surface as short bubbles. When the "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"supervisor receives your new instruction it shouts "老板发话了，都给我干起来！" ("The boss has spoken -- back to "},{"id":"p12s5","text":"work, everyone!") and calls every wandering worker back to their desk.
- **Idle wandering**: idle wo"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"rkers get up for coffee in the pantry, the whiteboard in the meeting room, or the sofa in the lounge"},{"id":"p12s7","text":" -- with a one-liner like "grab a coffee" when they arrive.
- **Dashboard**: live counts of total / "},{"id":"p12s8","text":"working / idle / queued workers."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Click interactions"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **Click a worker**: an info card with species, status, title (supervisor / worker), and what it is"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" doing right now.
- **Click a working worker's screen**: opens the **work monitor** window streaming"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" that agent's activity -- thinking, output, tool calls, and reports -- with inline markdown (bold / "},{"id":"p14s4","text":"inline code) support."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **Click the boss**: opens a mini input bar to issue orders directly to the current session (the su"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"pervisor) over the same channel as the main chat input. On success the bar collapses and the supervi"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"sor immediately shouts the order out; on failure the error shows inline in red and your draft is kep"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ely shouts the order out; on failure the error shows inline in red and your draft is kept for retry."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Pending approvals"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Whenever a session has a tool call awaiting approval, a question, or a plan review:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- that worker periodically bubbles "🙋 waiting for a decision";
- the office pops an approval card: a"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"pprove / reject in place for approvals, or a "go handle" button that jumps to the native panel for q"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"uestions and plan reviews;
- dismiss it with ✕ and that particular item stays quiet until it resolve"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"s; new items pop again."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### The corner office and the boss's daily routine"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The boss (you) has a private office: an executive desk, a monitor, a gold-trimmed high-back chair, a"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" bookshelf, plants, and a rug. The boss mostly works, with regular slacking:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- typing with a scrolling screen and a breathing golden glow while working;
- periodically napping f"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ace-down on the desk with lines like "☕ slacking off, do not disturb" or "let the workers run for a "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"while";
- occasionally strolling inside the office -- flipping through files, checking reports, wate"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ring plants, eavesdropping at the door -- but **never stepping out**, and no worker ever wanders in."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Camera"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- Drag to pan, wheel to zoom (cursor-anchored), double-click to reset to full view;
- auto-fits when"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"l to zoom (cursor-anchored), double-click to reset to full view;
- auto-fits when the panel resizes."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Prerequisite: the dsh CLI with the web profile (`dsh web`)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` after installing (the plugin graph is read at startup). An "Office" entry appears "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"at the top-right of the browser; click it to open the office panel on the right side while the conve"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"rsation stays in the center column."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"> Note: only `dsh plugin --profile web add` fully activates the two-half plugin; `--patch` with a fi"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"le:/// URL loads the host half only and the browser code is never discovered."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"> Installing from git pulls source and builds on install via the bundled `prepare` script; pnpm ≥10 "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"blocks install-time build scripts. **The first install attempt fails by design**: the error prints a"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"n exact key (with the git source) to add to the `pnpm-workspace.yaml` in your profile directory (`~/"},{"id":"p29s4","text":".dsh/profiles/web`) before re-running the install command:
>
[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":">
> Replace `<commit>` with the hash printed in the error. Note that the bare package name (`dsh-off"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ice-plugin: true`) does not work. To avoid the allowBuilds dance entirely, use the npm or tarball me"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"thod above -- prebuilt artifacts, no on-install build."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Uninstallation"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`. If the office entry still shows up afterwards, also remove the `"dsh-office-plugi"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"n"` line from the `bundles` list in `~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json` and restart again."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Usage guide"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"1. Start `dsh web` with the plugin installed, then click the office entry at the top-right;
2. The l"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"eft session sidebar auto-collapses for a wider view and restores when you close the panel;
3. Read t"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"he room: the dashboard plus lit/dark screens tell you the global state at a glance;
4. Click a worke"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"r for its info card; click a lit screen for the work monitor;
5. Click the boss to issue an order, o"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"r handle approvals right from the pop-up card;
6. Double-click the canvas any time to return to the "},{"id":"p35s6","text":"pprovals right from the pop-up card;
6. Double-click the canvas any time to return to the full view."}],"truncated":true}
